OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FA protestor who attempted to break
OL,8,Finto a hotel housing asylum seekers
OL,9,Fwhile draped in a Union flag has been
OL,10,Fhanded a suspended sentence.
OL,12,FRobert Scott, 47, from Bootle, tried
OL,13,Fto gain entry to the Richmond Hotel in
OL,14,FLiverpool while taking part in a
OL,15,Fprotest, and later went on to steal a
OL,16,FDeliveroo bag from a group of riders.
OL,18,FHe was given a 12-month sentence,
OL,19,Fsuspended for two years.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
