OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FScott joined an anti-immigration
OL,8,Fprotest on 9 June 2026, along with 100
OL,9,Fto 150 other people who were "shouting
OL,10,Fand being abusive... towards the
OL,11,Fpeople within the hotel".
OL,13,FJudge David Swinnerton said the
OL,14,Fprotest took place in the context of
OL,15,F"protecting women and girls from
OL,16,Fasylum seekers", but noted that Scott
OL,17,Fhad "domestic violence all over his
OL,18,Frecord".
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FThe court heard Scott, who has 44
OL,8,Fprevious convictions for 72 offences,
OL,9,Fhad damaged the door of the Richmond
OL,10,FHotel and tried to get in before being
OL,11,Fstopped by police officers.
OL,13,FThe judge said a "baying mob" of
OL,14,Fprotesters were outside the hotel.
OL,16,FHe said: "The general intention was,
OL,17,Fno doubt, to intimidate, and you, clad
OL,18,Fas you were in your Union Jack flag as
OL,19,Fa cloak, forced your way through the
OL,20,Fdoors.
OL,26,@uD@ROUuD@]O]xD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,F"Immediately behind you as you forced
OL,8,Fopen the doors of that hotel were 100
OL,9,Fto 150 people shouting and being
OL,10,Fabusive, and racially motivated abuse,
OL,11,Ftowards the people within that hotel."
OL,13,FThe protest then moved on to Bold
OL,14,FStreet, where Scott was captured on
OL,15,FCCTV near the Adelphi Hotel making off
OL,16,Fwith a Deliveroo bag from a group of
OL,17,Friders who had gathered there.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FHe later posted footage on TikTok
OL,8,F"celebrating" the theft. A picture on
OL,9,Fhis Facebook page showed the bag with
OL,10,Ffive pictures of Henry Nowak, whose
OL,11,Fmurder sparked protests in
OL,12,FSouthampton, stuck on to it.
OL,14,FThe judge said Scott saw the bag as a
OL,15,Fsymbol of immigrants and those from
OL,16,Fblack and minority ethnic backgrounds.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FHe said: "That's why you stole a
OL,8,FDeliveroo bag, to taunt them and
OL,9,Fbecause you appear to have found it
OL,10,Ffunny and others appear to have found
OL,11,Fit funny too.
OL,13,F"There was some comment about doing it
OL,14,F'for the clicks'."
OL,16,FThe court heard a community impact
OL,17,Fstatement set out the effect of the
OL,18,Fprotest on businesses, who had to pay
OL,19,Ffor taxis for staff to ensure they got
OL,20,Fhome safely.
OL,26,@oD@JOUuD@AOUvD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FJudge Swinnerton said: "The image of
OL,8,Fmobs coming down the street is not one
OL,9,Fwhich promotes the visitor economy."
OL,11,FThe defendant, who appeared over video
OL,12,Flink from prison with a bandaged arm,
OL,13,Ftold the court he was sorry for his
OL,14,Factions and said he had attempted to
OL,15,Ftake his own life.
OL,26,@oD@XOUqD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
