PN,36708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FNick Cockrell, defending, said: "It
OL,8,Fhasn't been an easy experience in
OL,9,Fcustody this time round and he is
OL,10,Fanxious, if he can, to receive a
OL,11,Fsentence which allows for his release
OL,12,Fand allows him to make some progress
OL,13,Fin the community."
OL,26,@oD@aOUuD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
