FL,368,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F367A1786645112
OL,3,CProtestor who tried to break into
OL,4,Casylum hotel wearing Union flag avoids
OL,5,Cjail
OL,7,FScott, who pleaded guilty to theft and
OL,8,Fcriminal damage at an earlier hearing,
OL,9,Fwas ordered to carry out 25 days of
OL,10,Frehabilitation activity, 100 hours of
OL,11,Funpaid work, 12 months of mental
OL,12,Fhealth treatment and was made subject
OL,13,Fto a trail monitoring tag requirement
OL,14,Ffor 12 months.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
